### What you need to do

You only need to do **one thing** now:

1. Go to your GitHub repository.
2. Open **`README.md`**.
3. Click **✏️ Edit**.
4. **Delete everything currently inside it.**
5. Paste the complete README above.
6. Scroll down.
7. Click **Commit changes**.

Your GitHub repository will then prominently show:

> 🚀 **LIVE DEMO — SecureScan AI**  
> 🌐 Frontend — Vercel  
> ⚙️ Backend — Render  
> 🗄️ Database — MySQL

And recruiters can directly click the **Live Demo** button to open your deployed project.
